WEBVTT

01:38.520 --> 01:41.880
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:48.400 --> 01:49.240
Grandfather.

01:50.080 --> 01:50.760
Father.

01:52.200 --> 01:53.040
Brother.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.480
This is Lady Qiao,

02:02.160 --> 02:03.120
my wife.

02:06.280 --> 02:10.320
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD WEI LUN

02:10.680 --> 02:13.520
SPIRIT TABLET
OF THE LATE LORD WEI JING

02:13.600 --> 02:17.600
SPIRIT TABLET OF WEI BAO
MY LATE BROTHER

02:28.120 --> 02:32.200
WEI

02:34.680 --> 02:35.440
Everyone,

02:35.520 --> 02:38.960
the Wei clan suffered
a great catastrophe 15 years ago.

02:39.040 --> 02:41.240
Our lineage dwindled,
and we declined more than once.

02:41.320 --> 02:43.880
But today, we have weathered the hardships

02:43.960 --> 02:45.080
and risen again.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.800
The suffering along the way

02:48.680 --> 02:49.720
was not borne by me alone.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.240
My grandmother and mother

02:53.360 --> 02:55.320
have guided me with great care.

02:57.120 --> 03:00.480
The support of all the clansmen
has also made today possible.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.040
Here's a toast to you.

03:07.360 --> 03:08.640
Beyond that,

03:08.720 --> 03:10.240
there is one more person I must thank.

03:14.880 --> 03:16.440
From this day on,

03:16.520 --> 03:18.560
only the future matters to us,
not the past.

03:19.240 --> 03:21.520
We will share fortune and hardship
and stand together through trials.

03:25.560 --> 03:27.200
Hatred is like a mountain.

03:27.280 --> 03:29.160
If it remains in our hearts,

03:29.840 --> 03:31.280
we cannot move forward.

03:31.840 --> 03:32.920
Zhonglin,

03:33.000 --> 03:36.200
it's good that you can remove
that mountain.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.240
Thank you, Grandmother.

03:47.240 --> 03:49.360
My lady, His Lordship is here.

03:50.200 --> 03:51.080
Mother.

03:51.960 --> 03:53.000
What's wrong?

03:53.080 --> 03:56.120
Zhonglin, there's something
about you and your wife

03:56.200 --> 03:58.680
that I've been meaning
to say for a long time.

03:58.760 --> 04:00.400
Today, let me tell you properly.

04:00.480 --> 04:01.720
I was wondering what it could be.

04:01.800 --> 04:03.800
I'm busy with work. Let's talk later.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.360
It won't take long.

04:06.320 --> 04:08.680
I know you two are in love now,

04:08.760 --> 04:09.760
but…

04:09.840 --> 04:12.520
how will you make her
utterly devoted to you?

04:12.600 --> 04:15.160
We've already talked about Lady Qiao
more than once.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.920
I have my own ideas.

04:17.399 --> 04:18.800
You don't.

04:19.200 --> 04:20.000
I…

04:20.079 --> 04:22.720
If you don't want your marriage
to sour over time,

04:22.800 --> 04:23.880
you two

04:23.960 --> 04:25.360
must have a child.

04:26.440 --> 04:28.120
So that's what this is about.

04:28.200 --> 04:29.200
She and I

04:29.280 --> 04:30.760
have already talked it over.

04:30.840 --> 04:32.320
Talking isn't enough.

04:32.800 --> 04:35.840
The clansmen think that
as long as you're in love,

04:35.920 --> 04:37.880
descendants will follow.

04:37.960 --> 04:38.800
I disagree.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.120
Why?

04:41.160 --> 04:42.000
Tell me.

04:42.080 --> 04:44.200
Because of the mourning period,

04:44.280 --> 04:46.200
you two haven't shared a bed

04:46.280 --> 04:47.760
for a whole year, right?

04:48.600 --> 04:49.400
I…

04:49.480 --> 04:51.280
Where are the kids supposed to come from?

04:53.560 --> 04:54.640
I have a way.

04:54.720 --> 04:56.480
Wait, you have a way?

04:56.560 --> 04:58.440
That was because of the mourning period.

04:58.520 --> 04:59.440
So we…

04:59.520 --> 05:01.000
There's no need for you to worry.

05:01.080 --> 05:01.920
Take this.

05:02.160 --> 05:03.920
Actually, back in Kangjun, she and I…

05:05.640 --> 05:08.240
Children come by fate.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.440
What fate?

05:09.520 --> 05:11.200
It depends on effort.

05:12.880 --> 05:15.160
I specially got this for you.

05:15.680 --> 05:16.560
What…

05:16.640 --> 05:17.520
What is it?

05:17.600 --> 05:18.480
I heard

05:18.560 --> 05:19.800
that if a wife

05:19.880 --> 05:24.800
puts on clothes or personal items worn by
a pregnant woman in recent months,

05:24.880 --> 05:27.640
she'll catch the good luck
and soon conceive.

05:29.280 --> 05:30.320
You believe that?

05:31.680 --> 05:34.480
I can tell Lady Qiao wants a child,

05:34.560 --> 05:35.760
so I asked around early on.

05:36.880 --> 05:39.160
This woman can bear children,

05:40.440 --> 05:42.320
but her husband is a butcher,

05:42.920 --> 05:44.200
so there's a bit of blood smell.

05:44.280 --> 05:45.520
But it doesn't matter.

05:45.600 --> 05:47.720
Take it back, put it under the bed,

05:47.800 --> 05:48.880
and don't say a word.

05:49.440 --> 05:50.520
It's for good luck.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.480
Will this really work?

05:54.560 --> 05:55.720
Of course.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.120
Time flies.

06:02.200 --> 06:04.760
His Lordship and Her Ladyship
have been married for over a year.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.080
Yes.

06:07.160 --> 06:10.960
It's been over a year since we got soaked
in the rain outside the city.

06:11.440 --> 06:13.440
Here we go again.

06:14.040 --> 06:15.920
Are you going to bring that up every year?

06:16.440 --> 06:19.200
Besides, I pleaded for you
with His Lordship back then.

06:19.280 --> 06:20.520
You even said

06:20.600 --> 06:22.520
that you'd serve whoever pleaded for you

06:22.600 --> 06:23.480
with all your heart.

06:24.600 --> 06:26.200
Are you asking me to serve you?

06:27.320 --> 06:28.600
Come on.

06:34.920 --> 06:35.800
No need for that.

06:36.280 --> 06:37.280
Just marry me.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.160
You want to marry me?

06:42.400 --> 06:44.080
Before I went off to war last time,

06:44.160 --> 06:45.760
I promised I'd ask your mother
for approval.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.840
I've fought beside His Lordship for years

06:52.920 --> 06:54.920
and risen from a foot soldier
to a general.

06:55.840 --> 06:57.120
Once I've saved up enough,

06:57.200 --> 06:59.760
I'll have His Lordship ask
for your mother's approval on my behalf.

06:59.840 --> 07:01.760
Why do you need to save up first?

07:01.840 --> 07:03.400
How much do you need?

07:03.480 --> 07:04.560
The more, the better.

07:04.640 --> 07:06.400
You don't even have a number in mind.

07:06.480 --> 07:08.400
What if you spend more than what you earn?

07:08.480 --> 07:10.200
Do I have to wait forever then?

07:10.560 --> 07:11.720
Are you serious about this?

07:12.200 --> 07:14.440
I am serious about marrying you.

07:14.520 --> 07:15.960
The more I save,

07:16.040 --> 07:17.480
the bigger the betrothal gift.

07:18.360 --> 07:19.680
I don't need that.

07:19.760 --> 07:21.280
- I have to save.
- No need.

07:21.360 --> 07:23.040
- I insist.
- No need.

07:23.120 --> 07:23.880
I have to save.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.760
Why are you so stubborn?

07:25.840 --> 07:27.880
I don't know whether to call you devoted

07:27.960 --> 07:29.480
or just thick-headed.

07:29.560 --> 07:30.760
I said I didn't need it.

07:30.840 --> 07:31.680
It's done.

07:36.800 --> 07:37.640
What's wrong?

07:42.040 --> 07:43.200
Take your time saving.

07:43.960 --> 07:45.240
I'm not in a rush anyway.

07:46.600 --> 07:48.240
The meat's not done.
Where are you going?

07:48.320 --> 07:49.600
You've fed me full of anger.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.120
Tao, you look good.

07:54.160 --> 07:55.800
Why is she suddenly upset?

07:56.320 --> 07:57.880
Great food.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.560
Let me try some.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.000
No, no, no.

08:02.080 --> 08:03.320
That's for Xiaotao.

08:04.280 --> 08:05.160
You eat those.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.600
All you ever think about is food.

08:06.680 --> 08:08.400
Don't you get what she was saying?

08:09.000 --> 08:10.040
What do you mean?

08:11.560 --> 08:12.640
She's eager to marry you.

08:16.280 --> 08:17.240
What to do then?

08:19.960 --> 08:21.520
Do you still have your wages?

08:21.600 --> 08:22.440
Lend me some.

08:22.520 --> 08:23.560
No. Let's eat.

08:24.760 --> 08:26.880
The richest man in this place
is sitting in the office.

08:26.960 --> 08:27.920
Ask him, not me.

08:29.560 --> 08:30.400
Go on.

08:36.679 --> 08:37.559
I heard

08:37.640 --> 08:38.880
that if a wife

08:38.960 --> 08:43.880
puts on clothes or personal items worn by
a pregnant woman in recent months,

08:43.960 --> 08:46.520
she'll catch the good luck
and soon conceive.

08:49.800 --> 08:50.960
Mr. Gongsun.

09:01.760 --> 09:03.000
My lord.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.880
What do you need?

09:08.840 --> 09:10.440
I want to ask you

09:11.000 --> 09:13.080
if there have been any movements
near Boya lately.

09:15.040 --> 09:15.880
Probably not.

09:17.440 --> 09:18.520
I believe there have been.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.080
After this battle,

09:21.160 --> 09:23.960
I've realized relying on Xiaogang alone

09:24.040 --> 09:25.560
is not enough to protect Panyi.

09:25.640 --> 09:27.560
Panyi is a key hub for the channel.

09:27.640 --> 09:29.280
Every lord wants it.

09:29.360 --> 09:30.480
It must not fall.

09:32.080 --> 09:32.960
Now,

09:33.040 --> 09:34.560
with the Qiao-Wei alliance,

09:34.640 --> 09:35.920
I want to join forces with Boya

09:37.120 --> 09:38.240
to reinforce our military

09:38.320 --> 09:40.280
and secure Panyi together.

09:41.560 --> 09:43.200
Mr. Gongsun,

09:43.280 --> 09:44.120
what do you think?

09:46.160 --> 09:47.640
It makes sense.

09:48.320 --> 09:49.600
But there's no rush.

09:49.680 --> 09:51.600
We can wait until we've entertained
all the state lords.

09:51.680 --> 09:52.440
No.

09:52.800 --> 09:54.720
I believe this must be done quickly.

09:54.800 --> 09:55.520
I'm in a hurry.

09:56.600 --> 09:59.400
And I need to figure out who to send.

10:01.080 --> 10:02.880
Whom do you plan to send?

10:05.000 --> 10:05.840
My lord.

10:07.480 --> 10:09.120
My lord, Mr. Gongsun.

10:09.200 --> 10:10.880
- My lord, I have a request.
- Hold on.

10:10.960 --> 10:11.960
You're just in time.

10:12.520 --> 10:15.480
I was telling Mr. Gongsun that
I plan to reinforce Boya.

10:15.560 --> 10:18.640
You'll go deliver
the supplies on my behalf.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.120
Any objections?

10:20.840 --> 10:22.800
- I…
- Good. It's settled.

10:23.280 --> 10:24.360
You leave immediately.

10:25.160 --> 10:26.000
Yes.

10:27.720 --> 10:29.840
Also, there's one more thing.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.960
While you're there,

10:33.040 --> 10:36.400
ask the Commander's wife
for two pieces of her personal clothing.

10:36.480 --> 10:39.440
Tell her the Lady of Wei misses her
and wants a token of comfort.

10:40.200 --> 10:40.920
Got that?

10:42.120 --> 10:43.080
Yes.

10:43.160 --> 10:44.120
Also,

10:45.440 --> 10:48.320
make sure it's something she's worn
in the last few months, okay?

10:50.200 --> 10:51.000
Yes.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.160
Also,

10:52.240 --> 10:54.560
if she has any baby clothes

10:54.640 --> 10:55.800
or toys set aside,

10:55.880 --> 10:56.960
bring back a few.

10:57.040 --> 10:58.040
No need to ask questions.

10:58.120 --> 10:58.960
Just take them.

11:00.640 --> 11:01.480
Yes.

11:03.080 --> 11:03.960
Also…

11:10.200 --> 11:12.040
If I think of anything else,
I'll let you know.

11:12.280 --> 11:13.200
Now go.

11:13.280 --> 11:14.120
Yes.

11:21.600 --> 11:24.000
This character Li is good,

11:24.880 --> 11:26.880
but it means departure.

11:27.400 --> 11:29.480
I'm afraid it'd be unlucky.

11:31.000 --> 11:31.840
No.

11:33.840 --> 11:34.680
Feng?

11:37.000 --> 11:37.800
I remember

11:37.880 --> 11:40.280
that I once knew someone
who had Feng in his name.

11:40.360 --> 11:42.920
His fate was full of hardship.

11:43.000 --> 11:43.920
Not good either.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.440
Qiuri…

11:50.240 --> 11:52.440
It means autumn that feels bleak.
Not good.

11:54.760 --> 11:55.960
Have some water, my lady.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.960
It's only been a few days' delay
in your period,

12:00.040 --> 12:03.000
and you're already picking baby names.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.560
It's a tough decision.

12:04.640 --> 12:07.000
Why not get His Lordship to help you?

12:10.200 --> 12:11.840
It's not certain yet.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.720
I'll tell him once I'm sure.

12:15.600 --> 12:18.160
Your tastes have changed lately.

12:18.240 --> 12:20.840
I'd say there's a high chance.

12:21.240 --> 12:24.440
Maybe you're carrying a little lady.

12:28.080 --> 12:31.680
BOYA

12:43.360 --> 12:44.240
General.

12:44.320 --> 12:46.200
General, why such a rush?

12:46.280 --> 12:48.080
Good thing you sent word in advance.

12:48.560 --> 12:51.360
His Lordship said I must go and return
swiftly without delay.

12:51.440 --> 12:53.200
Has your wife prepared it?

12:53.280 --> 12:54.440
Please, this way.

12:54.520 --> 12:55.640
This way.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.160
This garment won't do.

13:00.240 --> 13:02.000
The embroidery is worn.

13:03.760 --> 13:05.040
Not this one either.

13:06.080 --> 13:06.920
My lady.

13:08.720 --> 13:09.800
What do you think of these?

13:10.160 --> 13:12.640
This hairpin is way too intricate.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.920
The gold thread is blinding.

13:14.000 --> 13:16.240
Xing, put away these tacky things.

13:16.320 --> 13:17.560
The Lord of Wei treats her well.

13:17.640 --> 13:19.200
She has no shortage of these.

13:19.280 --> 13:22.640
We need to choose something exquisite
that she truly likes.

13:32.880 --> 13:34.520
My lady, that won't do.

13:34.600 --> 13:36.360
The general made this for you.

13:37.080 --> 13:38.360
I remember

13:38.440 --> 13:40.440
that on the day she helped me
and Bi Zhi escape,

13:40.520 --> 13:41.720
she teased me,

13:41.800 --> 13:43.400
saying she liked my konghou.

13:43.480 --> 13:46.600
When you heard it was for the Lady of Wei,

13:46.680 --> 13:48.840
you nearly turned
the entire storeroom inside out.

13:50.000 --> 13:51.320
In that case,

13:51.400 --> 13:57.080
why didn't you speak frankly with her
and clear up the misunderstanding?

13:59.640 --> 14:01.040
The closer you get,

14:01.120 --> 14:02.560
the harder it is to say that.

14:02.880 --> 14:03.840
Fan,

14:04.320 --> 14:05.800
you're almost due.

14:05.880 --> 14:07.040
Why do this yourself?

14:07.640 --> 14:09.160
Others don't know Manman's tastes.

14:10.560 --> 14:12.040
General Wei Liang said

14:12.120 --> 14:14.120
a few ordinary clothes would do.

14:14.840 --> 14:16.800
The last time Manman asked me for things,

14:16.880 --> 14:18.560
it was when you and I escaped.

14:19.680 --> 14:22.000
She picked out many things I like.

14:22.600 --> 14:24.640
This time,
I want to pick some for her too.

14:26.360 --> 14:27.200
Fan,

14:27.800 --> 14:28.560
you're so kind.

14:29.880 --> 14:32.080
No rush. Let's take our time choosing.

14:58.680 --> 15:02.560
CHIJUN, LIANGYA

15:06.680 --> 15:07.400
My lord,

15:07.880 --> 15:10.640
three factions among our allies

15:10.720 --> 15:12.160
have turned to Wei.

15:12.240 --> 15:14.680
I will make those traitors pay.

15:16.040 --> 15:19.000
But right now, we need rest and recovery.

15:19.480 --> 15:21.800
Liangya can't endure more turmoil.

15:22.520 --> 15:27.720
Though Lady Yulou was worth more
than Xiaoqiao was back then

15:27.800 --> 15:29.920
and brought us 50,000 troops,

15:30.480 --> 15:32.600
she incited the attack on Panyi,

15:32.680 --> 15:35.440
which caused our huge losses today.

15:37.600 --> 15:38.880
It's not her fault.

15:38.960 --> 15:40.040
I intended to attack anyway.

15:40.120 --> 15:42.360
But it wasn't meant to be so rushed.

15:42.960 --> 15:44.720
Ultimately, it's her fault.

15:45.200 --> 15:47.040
You mustn't indulge her anymore.

15:47.480 --> 15:49.320
You're the one I'm indulging.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.600
My lord, I'm sorry.

15:55.080 --> 15:56.160
I know my mistake.

15:59.880 --> 16:00.760
My lord,

16:01.200 --> 16:01.920
now,

16:02.000 --> 16:03.800
will Lady Yulou

16:04.680 --> 16:06.160
betray you

16:06.640 --> 16:08.400
after such a great defeat?

16:25.640 --> 16:29.080
Most of Wei Shao's forces were tied down
by the canal construction,

16:29.160 --> 16:30.320
yet Liu Yan still lost.

16:30.400 --> 16:32.360
I think he's useless.

16:32.440 --> 16:35.280
If General Lin's troops
had arrived on time,

16:35.360 --> 16:36.600
he might have won.

16:38.200 --> 16:41.080
But now, I think they're scared.

16:41.160 --> 16:42.680
We should return to Juejun.

16:50.560 --> 16:51.960
You've protected me so well.

16:52.560 --> 16:54.480
If my husband knew,

16:54.560 --> 16:55.520
he'd be relieved.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.880
But I promised him

16:59.960 --> 17:01.400
I'd fight for this land.

17:02.520 --> 17:03.960
Though he's gone,

17:04.560 --> 17:05.880
I must not break my word.

17:06.319 --> 17:08.400
Why do you value
the Lord of Liangya so much?

17:09.720 --> 17:11.079
It's not that.

17:11.800 --> 17:13.359
I just have no other choice.

17:14.560 --> 17:17.400
Who else can stand against Wei Shao now?

17:20.280 --> 17:22.720
If I want to unite the states
to resist Wei,

17:23.560 --> 17:24.920
someone must take the lead.

17:26.160 --> 17:28.000
Then let's see if he dares.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.840
I won't let him give up.

18:18.280 --> 18:19.320
Lady Yulou.

18:19.720 --> 18:21.480
His Lordship is handling affairs.

18:22.000 --> 18:23.760
How dare you barge in like this?

18:37.600 --> 18:39.120
My lady, why are you here?

18:40.320 --> 18:42.040
I'm betrothed to you.

18:42.680 --> 18:43.880
Have you forgotten?

18:45.560 --> 18:46.840
I planned

18:46.920 --> 18:48.560
to take this realm as my betrothal gift.

18:48.640 --> 18:50.720
I thought to wait

18:51.120 --> 18:52.960
until you won to marry you.

18:54.160 --> 18:55.560
But now,

18:56.840 --> 18:58.680
it seems the time is right.

18:59.640 --> 19:01.040
What do you mean?

19:03.000 --> 19:04.840
Last night, I had a dream.

19:05.840 --> 19:07.480
In a trance,

19:07.560 --> 19:10.480
a golden light fell from the beams,

19:11.360 --> 19:12.880
circling several times,

19:12.960 --> 19:14.360
and then transformed into a dragon,

19:14.440 --> 19:16.080
whipping its tail over Liangya.

19:17.160 --> 19:18.720
When I woke, I knew

19:19.400 --> 19:20.400
the time had come.

19:22.200 --> 19:24.040
Dreams

19:24.560 --> 19:26.000
can't be taken seriously.

19:28.720 --> 19:30.400
You're trapped in Liangya

19:30.480 --> 19:32.280
like a dragon trapped in shallow waters.

19:33.280 --> 19:35.160
I want to marry you

19:35.640 --> 19:38.400
to help you rise swiftly

19:38.480 --> 19:40.240
and become the ruler of all.

19:43.360 --> 19:45.080
But I just lost to Wei Shao.

19:46.520 --> 19:48.560
You didn't lose because you were weak

19:48.640 --> 19:50.960
but because you didn't understand

19:51.040 --> 19:53.200
Wei Shao or the Qiao clan

19:53.280 --> 19:55.200
and misplaced your strength.

20:00.120 --> 20:06.000
I've been twice to Yujun
to break the Qiao-Wei alliance.

20:07.240 --> 20:09.120
But I chose the wrong target.

20:10.920 --> 20:15.320
Once the Wei clan trusts an ally or kin,

20:15.400 --> 20:18.200
they're open and loyal.

20:19.280 --> 20:22.320
However, the Qiao clan
sways with the wind.

20:23.280 --> 20:25.640
They're easier to break
than the Lord of Wei.

20:26.960 --> 20:29.080
You should start with the Qiao clan.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.520
It will be easier to deal
a heavy blow to Wei Shao.

20:34.600 --> 20:35.640
In that case,

20:36.720 --> 20:37.680
Lady Yulou,

20:37.760 --> 20:39.760
why not visit the Qiao clan yourself
to lobby them?

20:39.840 --> 20:41.520
The Qiaos aren't enough.

20:44.240 --> 20:47.000
I'm willing to go
to the other states for you,

20:47.880 --> 20:49.200
explain the stakes,

20:49.680 --> 20:52.160
and persuade them to join Liangya

20:52.520 --> 20:53.560
to fight against Wei.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.960
I am willing to marry you

21:06.040 --> 21:07.720
and give my utmost to assist you.

21:08.960 --> 21:11.560
I only hope you will soon rise

21:13.040 --> 21:14.320
and claim the Central Plains.

21:14.880 --> 21:16.200
Since you trust me,

21:16.280 --> 21:17.600
I will not let you down.

21:18.320 --> 21:19.760
If I gain the realm,

21:19.840 --> 21:21.000
I will share it with you.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.720
My lord,

21:29.600 --> 21:31.160
I was born with a most auspicious fate.

21:31.680 --> 21:34.480
But the wings of my nose
are blocking my fortune.

21:35.280 --> 21:36.960
Only the element of gold

21:37.040 --> 21:38.240
can overcome this.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.560
So I wear this golden butterfly mask.

21:47.280 --> 21:48.160
My lord.

21:49.800 --> 21:51.600
Our troops are still resting.

21:52.040 --> 21:53.800
We must not act rashly.

21:56.080 --> 21:57.440
I've told you already

21:57.520 --> 21:58.880
that you're only my servant.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.600
If you forget that again,

22:01.200 --> 22:02.680
I'll send you underground

22:02.760 --> 22:06.080
so that my father can teach you
the meaning of rank.

22:12.600 --> 22:13.560
Understood.

22:33.080 --> 22:34.360
WEI MANSION, WEI

22:34.440 --> 22:35.720
General Wei Liang, you're back.

22:36.760 --> 22:37.600
Xiaotao's not here.

22:38.480 --> 22:39.160
Well.

22:39.680 --> 22:40.600
Where did she go, then?

22:40.680 --> 22:42.120
She's attending to Her Ladyship.

22:42.920 --> 22:44.680
But I asked around.

22:44.760 --> 22:45.960
Xiaozao is on duty today.

22:46.840 --> 22:48.320
Then she must be at the laundry.

22:48.400 --> 22:50.120
I checked the laundry too.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.680
No one went to do the laundry.

22:53.960 --> 22:55.400
Then she went shopping.

22:55.480 --> 22:57.880
But I just came from the streets.

22:58.360 --> 22:59.240
I looked everywhere.

22:59.320 --> 23:00.880
Just now, I saw someone with a bun go in.

23:00.960 --> 23:02.000
That has to be…

23:02.080 --> 23:03.120
That has to be her.

23:04.120 --> 23:04.920
What do you mean?

23:05.400 --> 23:06.640
Why are you talking to me here?

23:07.240 --> 23:08.320
Listen.

23:08.840 --> 23:10.600
I'm Xiaotao's mother.

23:11.280 --> 23:12.880
If you upset me,

23:12.960 --> 23:15.360
I won't let her marry you
even if she wants to.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.040
Now leave.

23:17.760 --> 23:19.080
I'm going.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.400
Mother,

23:23.520 --> 23:24.760
let me talk to him.

23:36.560 --> 23:39.120
Xiaotao, don't be mad.

23:39.920 --> 23:41.440
I left in a hurry.

23:41.520 --> 23:43.320
His Lordship was in a rush.

23:43.400 --> 23:45.080
I came looking for you
as soon as I got back.

23:45.880 --> 23:48.400
I even asked him for reward money.

23:48.480 --> 23:49.800
I've been saving it.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.880
Then, is it enough?

23:54.000 --> 23:54.720
Almost.

23:55.840 --> 23:56.800
Almost?

23:56.880 --> 23:57.680
So,

23:57.760 --> 23:59.320
when will it be enough?

23:59.400 --> 24:00.800
We're almost there.

24:03.080 --> 24:04.480
I don't need much.

24:04.560 --> 24:06.720
It's not like I want a house or anything.

24:08.000 --> 24:09.320
You want a house?

24:09.400 --> 24:10.600
Then keep waiting.

24:10.680 --> 24:12.160
I said I didn't want one.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.520
Once I've saved enough, I'll come back.

24:18.320 --> 24:19.440
Mother,

24:20.000 --> 24:21.640
he left again.

24:22.160 --> 24:23.320
What a fool.

24:25.400 --> 24:26.720
He's not a fool.

24:27.360 --> 24:28.600
He values you.

24:29.160 --> 24:31.400
He's afraid he's not worthy of you,

24:31.480 --> 24:33.880
so he wants to do more.

24:33.960 --> 24:35.440
Only then will he feel at ease.

24:41.440 --> 24:42.520
I like

24:43.720 --> 24:44.720
this son-in-law.

25:09.280 --> 25:11.000
Why are you back so early?

25:11.880 --> 25:12.880
I came back for a belt.

25:13.680 --> 25:15.880
Do you need to change it?
Did the old one break?

25:16.400 --> 25:18.840
No. I just don't like it.

25:18.920 --> 25:21.880
Help me find the one
with the phoenix embroidery.

25:23.800 --> 25:25.400
Since when do you care about that?

25:41.000 --> 25:41.880
Thanks.

25:46.400 --> 25:48.880
You seem to have been so tired lately.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.480
I do feel worn out.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.440
Then rest more.

25:55.520 --> 25:56.920
There's nothing going on here anyway.

25:57.000 --> 25:59.560
You don't have to check in
with Grandmother or Mother.

25:59.640 --> 26:00.400
Sleep in.

26:01.520 --> 26:02.720
I can't sleep.

26:03.440 --> 26:06.560
Also, I keep feeling sick and nauseous.

26:08.240 --> 26:10.560
Maybe you ate something bad.

26:10.640 --> 26:11.920
I'll get the physician.

26:12.000 --> 26:12.840
No need.

26:13.920 --> 26:15.480
Chunniang said

26:15.560 --> 26:17.520
she was like this
when pregnant with Xiaotao.

26:23.760 --> 26:25.080
That's not the same.

26:25.160 --> 26:26.360
That's pregnancy.

26:26.440 --> 26:27.800
You're throwing up and tired,

26:28.800 --> 26:30.440
and you haven't had your period
in a while.

26:30.520 --> 26:32.480
It must be something you ate.

26:32.560 --> 26:34.080
You remember my time of the month?

26:35.640 --> 26:36.680
Of course.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.080
I'll call the physician.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.480
What's wrong?

26:47.560 --> 26:49.880
Since you remember my time of the month,

26:52.000 --> 26:53.640
haven't you thought
of other possibilities?

26:58.080 --> 26:58.960
I…

27:03.640 --> 27:04.400
No way.

27:06.400 --> 27:07.440
Is it really that effective?

27:11.200 --> 27:12.040
Nothing.

27:12.120 --> 27:13.320
I'm just so happy.

27:30.840 --> 27:32.200
Chunniang said

27:32.280 --> 27:34.280
it felt like a girl.

27:35.360 --> 27:36.840
Either is great.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.720
I like girls.

27:41.320 --> 27:43.240
But I haven't picked

27:43.320 --> 27:44.760
a name for her.

27:45.360 --> 27:46.960
I've looked through so many books

27:47.040 --> 27:48.800
but found nothing that fits.

27:49.680 --> 27:52.440
How about I ask Grandmother
when I visit her tomorrow?

27:55.080 --> 27:56.520
I remember

27:56.600 --> 27:59.040
there's a mythical beast from Mount Huo

27:59.120 --> 28:00.240
called Feifei.

28:00.560 --> 28:03.440
They say whoever raises it
will live a carefree life.

28:03.520 --> 28:05.000
Why don't we use Feifei

28:05.080 --> 28:06.400
as the child's pet name?

28:06.760 --> 28:09.200
I hope you and our child

28:09.280 --> 28:10.440
can both live free from worry.

28:10.520 --> 28:11.640
Is that okay?

28:16.320 --> 28:17.440
Feifei.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.920
That sounds lovely.

28:30.880 --> 28:32.040
What's on your mind?

28:34.440 --> 28:35.560
I'm thinking…

28:35.640 --> 28:37.640
Now we're a family of three,

28:38.680 --> 28:41.720
and maybe we'll have more kids.

28:42.520 --> 28:44.040
I once promised you

28:44.120 --> 28:46.000
that I'd bring prosperity to your family.

28:46.080 --> 28:47.080
I won't break that promise.

28:50.160 --> 28:53.120
Once the canals stretch in all directions,

28:53.200 --> 28:55.280
bringing blessings to the people,

28:55.360 --> 28:57.560
trade will flourish and wealth will flow.

28:58.760 --> 29:00.440
I believe that by then,

29:00.520 --> 29:01.920
there will be no more war,

29:02.000 --> 29:03.440
and the people will live in peace.

29:04.000 --> 29:05.000
Let it be our gift

29:05.720 --> 29:07.280
to bless our child

29:07.840 --> 29:09.400
and the future of Wei.

29:11.320 --> 29:12.920
May our child

29:13.640 --> 29:15.560
live in an age of peace.

29:20.640 --> 29:21.520
They will.

29:26.880 --> 29:27.720
Manman,

29:28.360 --> 29:30.120
a man of the Wei clan

29:30.680 --> 29:32.880
never turns back
once he's made up his mind.

29:36.920 --> 29:39.040
In this life, I won't fail you.

29:51.040 --> 29:52.560
KANGJUN WHARF

29:52.640 --> 29:55.120
KANGJUN, YANZHOU

29:55.200 --> 29:56.240
Let's keep going in Kangjun.

29:56.320 --> 29:57.200
Keep singing.

29:57.280 --> 29:58.040
Louder!

29:58.120 --> 29:59.200
- Okay.
- Hurry!

29:59.280 --> 30:00.120
Circle around more.

30:00.560 --> 30:01.360
Go.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.360
One chi of cloth

30:03.440 --> 30:05.200
Can be sewn

30:05.520 --> 30:07.400
One peck of grain

30:07.480 --> 30:09.280
Can be pounded

30:09.600 --> 30:11.320
But two brothers

30:11.600 --> 30:13.360
Can't get along

30:13.640 --> 30:15.440
Prefect Qiao

30:15.520 --> 30:17.400
Is good at medicine

30:17.680 --> 30:19.600
Governor Qiao

30:19.680 --> 30:21.560
Is full of envy

30:21.640 --> 30:23.360
Prefect Qiao

30:23.680 --> 30:25.720
Knows right from wrong

30:25.800 --> 30:27.680
Governor Qiao

30:27.760 --> 30:29.720
Is a cowardly turtle

30:29.800 --> 30:31.800
Prefect Qiao

30:31.880 --> 30:33.720
Is wise and just

30:33.960 --> 30:35.840
Governor Qiao

30:36.160 --> 30:38.120
Is useless and timid

30:38.200 --> 30:41.160
KANGJUN WHARF

30:41.240 --> 30:42.280
USELESS AND TIMID

30:43.560 --> 30:45.000
Outrageous!

30:45.080 --> 30:46.320
Calm down, my lord.

30:46.960 --> 30:50.280
It's just some nonsense that
bratty kids made up.

30:50.360 --> 30:52.840
Could kids come up with that?

30:52.920 --> 30:57.120
Someone is spreading this,
trying to slander me.

31:02.440 --> 31:03.360
My lord,

31:04.360 --> 31:05.280
given the situation,

31:06.320 --> 31:08.920
even if you punish me now,

31:09.760 --> 31:11.160
I must say this.

31:11.880 --> 31:15.120
If you let these schemers
continue to run wild,

31:15.760 --> 31:17.360
you and Yanzhou

31:17.760 --> 31:18.720
may be

31:19.600 --> 31:20.440
in danger.

31:23.320 --> 31:24.960
What do you mean?

31:27.680 --> 31:28.600
My lord,

31:28.680 --> 31:30.480
you're the Governor of Yanzhou.

31:31.000 --> 31:32.800
You're respected greatly.

31:32.880 --> 31:34.840
But lately, when people talk of Yanzhou,

31:34.920 --> 31:37.000
they only mention Qiao Ping,
the Prefect of Kangjun.

31:37.080 --> 31:39.600
Who even brings up your name?

31:39.960 --> 31:43.240
Even the kids in Yanzhou
are spreading that ridiculous song.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.640
My lord, you're kind

31:48.400 --> 31:49.720
and loyal to your brother,

31:50.200 --> 31:51.320
but I

31:51.720 --> 31:52.800
worry

31:53.760 --> 31:54.760
for you.

31:56.280 --> 31:59.680
Now, the Lady of Wei is pregnant.

32:00.360 --> 32:03.400
When she gives birth to an heir,

32:04.120 --> 32:07.360
the prefect will become
the heir's maternal grandfather.

32:08.640 --> 32:10.480
By then,

32:11.960 --> 32:13.880
your position

32:14.560 --> 32:15.560
will be in jeopardy.

32:25.200 --> 32:28.680
MANSION OF THE LORD OF LIANGYA,
LIANGYA

32:46.920 --> 32:47.960
Now,

32:48.040 --> 32:49.200
everything is ready.

32:50.320 --> 32:54.160
My lord, may you win in Kangjun.

32:55.480 --> 32:57.560
My lady, may you succeed in your mission.

33:07.840 --> 33:08.720
Liu Xiao.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.120
My lord.

33:10.200 --> 33:11.680
Take 5,000 guards.

33:11.760 --> 33:13.600
Keep the Lady of Liangya safe
at all costs.

33:13.680 --> 33:14.520
Yes.

33:43.760 --> 33:44.600
My lord,

33:45.560 --> 33:46.480
may you win.

33:46.960 --> 33:48.480
I won't let you down.

33:54.320 --> 33:58.920
MANSION OF THE LORD OF LIANGYA

33:59.320 --> 34:00.280
Pass down my order.

34:00.360 --> 34:01.160
Let's depart.

34:01.240 --> 34:02.040
Yes.

34:02.120 --> 34:03.120
Depart!

34:28.560 --> 34:29.400
Father,

34:30.400 --> 34:31.120
run!

34:34.679 --> 34:35.560
Run!

34:36.600 --> 34:37.520
Manman.

34:38.360 --> 34:39.280
Manman?

34:39.360 --> 34:40.199
Father…

34:40.960 --> 34:41.760
Manman, wake up.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.679
Run!

34:45.760 --> 34:46.600
What's wrong?

34:52.520 --> 34:53.360
What happened?

34:56.520 --> 34:57.920
I dreamed

34:58.000 --> 34:59.840
my father and I were out in the wild.

34:59.920 --> 35:02.320
Behind him were several wolves,

35:02.400 --> 35:04.320
staring at him like prey.

35:05.040 --> 35:07.240
But he didn't even notice.

35:07.320 --> 35:09.400
I kept calling him,
but he couldn't hear me.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.520
It was just a dream.

35:14.680 --> 35:15.680
Maybe…

35:17.560 --> 35:19.360
the baby was moving

35:19.440 --> 35:20.480
and upset you.

35:22.040 --> 35:22.960
Maybe.

35:28.040 --> 35:28.840
How about this?

35:28.920 --> 35:30.600
If you're really that worried,

35:30.680 --> 35:33.880
I'll send someone to bring Father here
to live with us for a while.

35:34.400 --> 35:36.080
He can also be here when the baby is born.

35:38.040 --> 35:39.040
Really?

35:39.840 --> 35:40.680
Yes.

35:41.200 --> 35:42.760
There's no war in Yanzhou right now.

35:42.840 --> 35:44.440
He doesn't need to guard there.

35:44.520 --> 35:47.520
He can come and live with us
to enjoy some family time.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.760
You're so good to me.

35:54.560 --> 35:56.480
All right, go back to sleep.

35:56.560 --> 35:58.120
I'll figure out who to send tomorrow.

36:06.840 --> 36:08.280
Tao, Tao.

36:08.360 --> 36:10.520
Once I've saved enough for a house,
I'll come and marry you.

36:10.600 --> 36:12.200
You still want to marry me?

36:12.280 --> 36:13.680
I thought you didn't want to anymore.

36:13.760 --> 36:15.440
Of course I do.

36:15.840 --> 36:17.560
At the rate you're saving,

36:17.640 --> 36:19.720
we'll get married in ten years.

36:19.800 --> 36:23.200
I promise I'll save faster
and marry you soon.

36:29.000 --> 36:30.360
Do you think the moon is big?

36:32.920 --> 36:33.840
Yes.

36:33.920 --> 36:35.440
It's not as big as your dreams.

36:36.280 --> 36:37.800
Tao,

36:37.880 --> 36:40.120
I can save for the betrothal gift
and the house.

36:40.200 --> 36:42.480
But I can't get the moon for you.

36:42.560 --> 36:44.480
What do I need the moon for?

36:44.560 --> 36:45.760
Well.

36:45.840 --> 36:48.080
I can save up
for the betrothal gift and the house.

36:48.160 --> 36:50.840
What else do you want me to save for?
I can save up for them together.

36:50.920 --> 36:52.080
Still saving?

36:52.160 --> 36:54.160
It's been ages.

36:54.240 --> 36:55.920
Are you making me propose to you?

36:56.680 --> 36:57.680
Will that work?

36:57.760 --> 36:59.080
Of course not.

36:59.160 --> 37:00.520
What do you want me to save for then?

37:01.480 --> 37:02.960
Why don't you get it?

37:03.040 --> 37:04.240
Look at His Lordship.

37:04.880 --> 37:07.000
When he proposed to Her Ladyship,

37:07.080 --> 37:08.600
he hunted a lynx for her.

37:08.680 --> 37:09.720
That's impressive.

37:10.600 --> 37:12.280
- I'm going now.
- Come back.

37:13.040 --> 37:14.360
I don't want a lynx.

37:14.440 --> 37:15.440
Then…

37:17.520 --> 37:18.720
Come here, come on.

37:23.560 --> 37:24.520
See that?

37:26.040 --> 37:27.080
The lamp stove?

37:28.680 --> 37:29.880
You look like a lamp stove.

37:30.400 --> 37:31.440
Look to your left.

37:34.760 --> 37:35.760
At what?

37:36.320 --> 37:37.480
The orchid.

37:39.760 --> 37:40.720
Oh, the orchid.

37:41.920 --> 37:43.440
That's an orchid from Yanzhou.

37:44.240 --> 37:46.360
Mr. Wei once gave it to Her Ladyship.

37:46.440 --> 37:48.440
She poured boiling water on it.

37:48.520 --> 37:50.240
I thought it had died,

37:50.800 --> 37:52.520
but it has grown new buds lately.

37:53.040 --> 37:53.880
Amazing, right?

37:56.560 --> 37:58.560
When it blooms, it's really beautiful.

37:58.640 --> 38:00.520
I've been taking care of it every day.

38:01.360 --> 38:03.720
It's my favorite thing right now.

38:08.080 --> 38:10.000
I know how you feel about me.

38:10.360 --> 38:12.040
You want me to live well.

38:13.040 --> 38:15.320
But I really don't care
about money or houses.

38:16.280 --> 38:17.920
Besides, I earn more than you.

38:20.920 --> 38:22.600
If you really want to marry me,

38:23.600 --> 38:25.200
just give me this orchid.

38:29.640 --> 38:31.960
Your sincerity is the best betrothal gift.

38:50.680 --> 38:53.800
Fetching His Lordship's father-in-law
from Yanzhou…

38:54.920 --> 38:56.760
What kind of job is that?

38:58.760 --> 38:59.800
Same old rule.

39:00.800 --> 39:02.480
Whoever loses goes.

39:02.560 --> 39:03.760
What rule?

39:03.840 --> 39:05.040
His Lordship picked you.

39:05.120 --> 39:06.200
No need to pull straws.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.840
When did he say that?

39:08.200 --> 39:09.880
Didn't he say we'd decide together?

39:15.280 --> 39:16.440
What are you staring at?

39:17.160 --> 39:18.400
Can't you see that big thing?

39:19.240 --> 39:20.760
- What is it?
- Look closely.

39:21.360 --> 39:22.200
The moon?

39:24.240 --> 39:25.040
Where were you just now?

39:26.080 --> 39:27.640
Xiaotao said

39:27.720 --> 39:29.400
the betrothal gift is this Yanzhou orchid.

39:29.880 --> 39:32.280
Once I get it to fully bloom,

39:32.360 --> 39:33.640
she'll marry me.

39:40.240 --> 39:41.280
Liang,

39:41.360 --> 39:43.960
I've got just the task for you.

39:44.360 --> 39:45.760
Don't say I didn't give you a chance.

39:45.840 --> 39:46.680
What is it?

39:48.560 --> 39:50.200
His Lordship needs someone

39:50.280 --> 39:52.160
to go to Yanzhou
and bring back his father-in-law.

39:53.000 --> 39:53.960
You go

39:54.040 --> 39:56.400
and bring back an orchid too.

39:56.480 --> 39:57.800
Then you can marry Xiaotao.

39:57.880 --> 39:59.040
But I already have one.

39:59.120 --> 40:00.280
That's not the same.

40:00.360 --> 40:02.440
That's the one
Mr. Wei gave to Her Ladyship.

40:02.520 --> 40:03.640
Don't think I don't know.

40:03.720 --> 40:06.120
You can't use that one
if you're serious about marrying Xiaotao.

40:06.200 --> 40:08.760
If you really gave her that,
I'd feel sorry for her.

40:09.920 --> 40:11.040
- Wei Xiao.
- Well…

40:11.120 --> 40:12.640
- Don't you think so?
- Stop.

40:12.720 --> 40:13.800
Don't drag me into tricking him.

40:13.880 --> 40:14.920
I'm not tricking him.

40:15.000 --> 40:16.560
Duo, you're too young for this.

40:16.640 --> 40:17.560
Just tell him the truth.

40:18.240 --> 40:19.720
If you believe so.

40:20.040 --> 40:22.280
- We have to trick someone anyway.
- I'm not tricking him.

40:23.960 --> 40:25.200
Don't listen to them.

40:25.760 --> 40:27.800
Let me analyze it for you.

40:27.880 --> 40:29.080
With your clumsy hands,

40:29.160 --> 40:31.360
how long would it take you
to make an orchid bloom?

40:31.440 --> 40:32.960
You know the road to Kangjun.

40:33.040 --> 40:34.400
It's a short trip.

40:34.920 --> 40:37.680
If you go to Kangjun, you can bring back
His Lordship's father-in-law

40:37.760 --> 40:39.600
and pick up an orchid on the way.

40:39.680 --> 40:41.440
Then you can marry Xiaotao
when you get back.

40:43.960 --> 40:45.440
It makes sense.

40:45.800 --> 40:47.000
Look at Wei Qu.

40:47.080 --> 40:48.360
Then look at you two,

40:48.840 --> 40:50.120
always tricking me.

40:53.880 --> 40:56.040
The moon really is big tonight.

40:56.720 --> 40:59.840
How long has it been
since we watched the moon together?

40:59.920 --> 41:01.800
There will be more chances.

41:01.880 --> 41:02.600
Yeah.

41:03.840 --> 41:05.240
When you come back,

41:05.320 --> 41:07.080
Xiaotao will be watching the moon
with you.

41:39.520 --> 41:41.160
YUJUN

41:41.240 --> 41:42.440
Liang, safe travels.

41:42.520 --> 41:43.720
Show me some respect.

41:44.320 --> 41:46.160
- Don't come back all skinny.
- I won't.

41:46.240 --> 41:47.280
I mean your horse.

41:47.360 --> 41:48.480
Go away.

41:49.320 --> 41:50.360
Listen to your brothers.

41:50.600 --> 41:51.400
- Bye.
- Bye.

41:51.480 --> 41:52.280
Take care.

41:52.360 --> 41:53.240
Wei Liang.

42:00.520 --> 42:01.600
What are you doing here?

42:01.680 --> 42:03.200
You're really going to Yanzhou?

42:04.440 --> 42:05.720
What for?

42:06.880 --> 42:08.240
To bring back Her Ladyship's father.

42:08.320 --> 42:09.320
He'll live here for a while.

42:11.720 --> 42:12.960
There's nothing else?

42:17.880 --> 42:20.800
I'll go and pick a real Yanzhou orchid

42:20.880 --> 42:22.400
to propose to you with.

42:28.160 --> 42:29.000
Goodbye.

42:29.080 --> 42:30.080
Be careful on the road.

43:03.240 --> 43:04.400
QIAO MANSION, YANZHOU

43:04.480 --> 43:06.120
Who exactly did you call me here to meet?

43:06.200 --> 43:08.560
My lord, if you want
to turn things around now,

43:08.640 --> 43:10.400
this is the only one person who can help.

43:10.480 --> 43:11.960
Who might that be?

43:24.400 --> 43:25.240
I…

43:27.040 --> 43:28.280
It's you?
